WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.031 --> 00:00:06.531
The Astro bike zoomed away.

2
00:00:06.532 --> 00:00:09.978
"That's Vern!" Bex said.

3
00:00:09.979 --> 00:00:13.731
"Let's go, Bot!" Ringo said.

4
00:00:13.732 --> 00:00:17.574
"I'll stay and clear the smoke," Lucy said.

5
00:00:17.575 --> 00:00:26.876
"I'll help." PJ used his blowers.

6
00:00:26.877 --> 00:00:29.343
Ringo held onto Bot.

7
00:00:29.344 --> 00:00:35.812
Bot zoomed after Vern.

8
00:00:35.813 --> 00:00:42.081
She shot through fields and over hills.

9
00:00:42.082 --> 00:00:45.787
Vern's bike zipped over a stream.

10
00:00:45.788 --> 00:00:47.749
Bot zoomed across it.

11
00:00:47.750 --> 00:00:55.284
Splash! Water sprayed everywhere.

12
00:00:55.285 --> 00:01:01.189
Ringo and Bot arrived at Vern's farm.

13
00:01:01.190 --> 00:01:04.700
"We're from Space Patrol," Ringo said.

14
00:01:04.701 --> 00:01:08.843
"Why are you killing Bex's crops?"

15
00:01:08.844 --> 00:01:12.091
"I'll tell you why," Vern said.

16
00:01:12.092 --> 00:01:14.946
"She's stealing my crops!"

17
00:01:14.947 --> 00:01:17.006
Ringo was confused.

18
00:01:17.007 --> 00:01:21.143
"Bex wouldn't do that," Bot said.

19
00:01:21.144 --> 00:01:28.543
"I'll show you," Vern said.

20
00:01:28.544 --> 00:01:32.822
He led Ringo and Bot into his field.

21
00:01:32.823 --> 00:01:35.305
Ringo saw a few plants.

22
00:01:35.306 --> 00:01:39.493
But the field was almost empty.

23
00:01:39.494 --> 00:01:42.235
"See?" Vern said.

24
00:01:42.236 --> 00:01:44.986
"Someone is stealing my crops.

25
00:01:44.987 --> 00:01:47.067
Bex is the only—"

26
00:01:47.068 --> 00:01:51.024
Suddenly the ground shook.

27
00:01:51.025 --> 00:01:54.888
"What was that?" Ringo asked.

28
00:01:54.889 --> 00:01:59.285
Vern shook his head. "I don't know!"

29
00:01:59.286 --> 00:02:01.056
Shloomp!

30
00:02:01.057 --> 00:02:05.476
A moon root plant disappeared into the ground.

31
00:02:05.477 --> 00:02:10.855
Shloomp! Shloomp! More plants disappeared.

32
00:02:10.856 --> 00:02:16.859
Vern gulped. "My crops!"

